Minato's patch to frameworks/base's media/java/android/media/ImageWriter.java at android-15.0.0_r1 (Apache-2.0), the
graphics breadth's G3b (ADR-0058 e1)): the static initializer loads no libmedia_jni.

Why: as ImageReader's (imagereader-without-media-jni.patch): Android's ImageWriter natives live in libmedia_jni,
which Minato does not build; they are libandroid_runtime's (framework/native/android_runtime/
android_media_ImageWriter.cpp), registered when the process starts. nativeClassInit stays.

--- a/media/java/android/media/ImageWriter.java
+++ b/media/java/android/media/ImageWriter.java
@@ -1318,7 +1318,7 @@
     private static native void nativeClassInit();
 
     static {
-        System.loadLibrary("media_jni");
+        // Minato: the natives are libandroid_runtime's (android_media_ImageWriter.cpp), registered at the start.
         nativeClassInit();
     }
 }
